/&gt;As Grigg points out however, when it comes to state&lt;br /&gt;sponsored murder there is no absurd or extreme.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pope John Paul II warned that America was instituting&lt;br /&gt;a culture of death.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You don&amp;#39;t need the socratic method&lt;br /&gt;to guess where it will end.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8200722375311108722/comments/default/312981749863773312'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8200722375311108722/comments/default/312981749863773312'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/07/aftermath-in-aurora-child-killer-as.html?showComment=1342963417341#c312981749863773312' title=''/><author><name>willb</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/07/aftermath-in-aurora-child-killer-as.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8200722375311108722' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8200722375311108722' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1565557136"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 22, 2012 at 7:23 AM"/></entry></feed>